# A frame with nothing in it. Every `*_vec` is `[]` and `partial` is false -- the v1 shape a
# consumer must still parse, and the case where an empty complete frame and a partial one
# look identical unless `missing_stages` and `partial` are both written.
scenario empty_frame
camera cam9
frame 0
source shard-0
size 640 480
fps 1.0
reason complete
